than a group. \n</p><p>Although the drop chance is unknown its estimated to have a drop chance of about 10%. Or about 1 in 10 kills (1/10).\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163152\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019432/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.209      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.209      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:3909-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163152 and revision id 17462. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Sword","exists":true},{"title":"Skeletons","exists":false}],"images":["Dragonbone.png","Skeletonwithdragonbone.png"]}
